OL,5,G0505 Fern Britton: Inside the Vet's
OL,6,     FAndy performs surgery on a dog to
OL,7,     Fremove a worrying tumour from its
OL,8,     Fstomach, while Amy uses ultrasound
OL,9,     Fto investigate a cat's missing
OL,10,     Fkidney, and James removes an
OL,11,     Finfected wart from a geriatric
OL,12,     FSpringerdoodle. A two-year-old cat
OL,13,     Fis back for X-rays on its leg
OL,14,     Ffollowing surgery last year, and
